# playpick cell: mode=walk boss=saved spec=paladin:holy style=flee
# size=10 difficulty=normal view=390x844,touch save=carried (behaves as
# fresh, #273 -- carried never actually carries across separate playbot
# invocations because the dev-server port is derived from the process pid).
# `boss=saved` is a coverage label only (direction.md's 2026-09-25 note on
# playpick.ts): a mode=walk evening steers at no named boss, the walk
# starts at the door same as any other -- and the fresh/carried default is
# already 10-normal, so no #hash unlock is needed to reach this cell.
